THIRD-PARTY NOTICES
================================================================================

custom_components/nexo/nexo_client.py is a rewrite of pyNexo.py from
https://github.com/Tymec/NexoAPI, which is distributed under the following
licence. The wire protocol is unchanged; error handling, message framing and
the public API were rewritten.

