The text command layer follows the NexoTalk protocol as described in the
manufacturer's documentation at https://github.com/nexwell-mk/nexo-api. That
repository carries no licence, so none of its files are redistributed here;
only the protocol it describes is implemented, with short attributed
quotations in README.md.
